    {
      "id": "r2_t1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 336,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 149,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1753142400000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "32 WORKERS, PRIVATE COPIES\n\nEach process parses its own index into memory. Annoy's own math: 5M items × 40 floats × 4 bytes = 800MB. × 32 worker processes = 25.6GB — just to hold the same bytes 32 times over.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r2_b1",
      "originalText": "32 WORKERS, PRIVATE COPIES\n\nEach process parses its own index into memory. Annoy's own math: 5M items × 40 floats × 4 bytes = 800MB. × 32 worker processes = 25.6GB — just to hold the same bytes 32 times over.",
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
    {
