    },
    {
      "id": "t_mech",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 1090,
      "height": 112,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1753142400000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE MECHANISM MATCH\nAnnoy builds a forest of k trees: at each node, sample two points, split on the hyperplane equidistant between\nthem, recurse. A query walks multiple trees at once with a priority queue, inspecting up to search_k nodes\n(default n_trees × n) before stopping. Because the tree is built once and never mutated in place, it serializes\nto one flat, pointer-free, read-only file — exactly the shape mmap needs. The same trick that makes search fast\nis what makes sharing free.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "b_mech",
      "originalText": "THE MECHANISM MATCH\nAnnoy builds a forest of k trees: at each node, sample two points, split on the hyperplane equidistant between\nthem, recurse. A query walks multiple trees at once with a priority queue, inspecting up to search_k nodes\n(default n_trees × n) before stopping. Because the tree is built once and never mutated in place, it serializes\nto one flat, pointer-free, read-only file — exactly the shape mmap needs. The same trick that makes search fast\nis what makes sharing free.",
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "e_footnote",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 683,
      "width": 1140,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#555555",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1753142400000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Nothing here is free: approximate, not exact — a bad early split can prune away the true neighbor, and only more\ntrees or a higher search_k buys that back, at the cost of query time. And the file is read-only: one new track\nmeans rebuilding and redeploying the whole thing, no online insert.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Nothing here is free: approximate, not exact — a bad early split can prune away the true neighbor, and only more\ntrees or a higher search_k buys that back, at the cost of query time. And the file is read-only: one new track\nmeans rebuilding and redeploying the whole thing, no online insert.",
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    }
  ],
  "appState": {
